; Self test of the fixed form of the TED bug-orig tests
; (tests/bug-orig/CMakeLists.txt): the expectation does not hold of TED-C
; (the output of the command ends with rc=0, not rc=7), as if the fixed bug
; came back, so tedab must report REGRESSED (exit status 1) and name the
; bug.  99999 is no issue.
; @fixed #99999
; @source none
; @expect stdout "rc=7"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
